# Default multi-model fleet for herdr-multi-agent — author's usual six (daily).
#
# Heavy / max-diversity list: see fleet.full (pass --fleet-file $SKILL_DIR/fleet.full).
#
# WARNING: These model ids are author-specific. Third parties almost certainly
# need to override via:
#   --agent name=provider/model[:thinking]   (repeatable)
#   --agent name=kind:model                  (non-pi herdr kinds, e.g. cursor)
#   --fleet-file PATH
# or by editing this file.
#
# launch.sh runs kind-aware model preflight (unless --skip-model-preflight):
#   pi     -> pi --list-models
#   cursor -> cursor-agent --list-models (bare `agent` only if it is cursor-cli)
# and fails fast if entries are missing.
#
# Format:
#   shortname=provider/model[:thinking]   # kind=pi (default)
#   shortname=kind:model                  # herdr kind prefix (cursor/codex/...)
# Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Rationale (2026-08-12 dual-review gpt56sol + fable5;
#            2026-08-14 Go seat: glm53 replaces qwen38max;
#            2026-08-16 Cursor seat: k3max added;
#            2026-08-19 Go hy3: daily after quota 8x;
#            2026-08-20 drop glm52 + k27code as out of date;
#            2026-08-20 drop dots3 as unusable;
#            2026-08-21 Zen free oxalpha: Ox Alpha / x-preview-f-free:max
#            2026-08-21 SiliconFlow daily: dsv4flash 0731 replaces dsv4pro preview
#            2026-08-22 gpt56sol: ChatGPT Codex sub dead; switch to cursor:gpt-5.6-sol-xhigh
#            2026-08-22 oxalpha: OpenRouter stealth/ox-alpha (OpenCode Go/Zen unstable)
#            2026-08-23 g37flash: Antigravity CLI gemini-3.7-flash-high
#            2026-08-25 drop glm53: OpenCode Go quota exhausted
#            2026-08-26 drop hy3: OpenCode Go quota exhausted):
#   - Keep anchors: cursor sol-xhigh + cursor fable thinking-high
#   - Cursor seats: gpt56sol + fable5 + k3max
#   - Antigravity seat: g37flash=agy:gemini-3.7-flash-high (Mac Google login)
#   - No daily opencode-go seat; hy3 and glm53 are out of both fleets
#   - OpenRouter seat oxalpha=openrouter/stealth/ox-alpha:max (not OpenCode Zen/Go)
#   - SiliconFlow daily seat is dsv4flash (V4-Flash-0731; public id DeepSeek-V4-Flash, not -0731)
#   - hy3, glm53, glm52, k27code, dsv4pro, and dots3 are out of both fleets
#   - Drop opencode-go k3 entirely; mimopro stays in fleet.full; qwen38max is out

gpt56sol=cursor:gpt-5.6-sol-xhigh
oxalpha=openrouter/stealth/ox-alpha:max
dsv4flash=siliconflow/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Flash:max
# Cursor CLI (herdr kind=cursor → cursor-agent/agent); --trust --force at launch
fable5=cursor:claude-fable-5-thinking-high
k3max=cursor:kimi-k3-max
g37flash=agy:gemini-3.7-flash-high
